# `next dev` writes these two itself (next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js):
# a block of coding instructions for AI agents, plus a CLAUDE.md that imports it.
# Their content is owned by whatever version of Next is installed and changes
# without review, so they are not something this repository should carry — the
# project's own guidance lives in CONTRIBUTING.md and docs/. Untracked, they are
# still written and still read locally; they just cannot ride along in a commit.
frontend/AGENTS.md
frontend/CLAUDE.md
